WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:04.820
I’m giving the perfect devil fruit to each
straw hat. I saw that my friend Zack over

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:09.510
on his channel Im D. King tried to figure
out the best fruit for each straw hat that

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:13.630
doesn’t have one already. Which sounded
like a ton of fun, so I’m going to be doing

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:17.420
the same thing, but this time, not only will
i try to find even better fruits, but I will

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.110
also upgrade the fruits of those straw hats
who already have eaten a fruit. All of these

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:21.740
are going to be absolutely broken.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:27.039
Starting with Sanji. Now, Zack ended up giving
Sanji Whitebeard’s earthquake fruit, which

00:00:27.039 --> 00:00:32.201
would turn Sanji’s kicks into some of the
most devastating attacks in One PIece. No

00:00:32.201 --> 00:00:37.950
doubt a great pick. Definitely better than
what Oda, the author of one piece, proposed

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:43.900
for Sanji’s devil fruit: Senor Pink’s
swim swim fruit, which allows the user to&nbsp;***swim***

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:48.120
in the ground or walls. Which is powerful,
but doesn’t fit Sanji’s fighting style

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:55.739
or personality at all. Let’s find him something
that will actually work with his powers. Sanji’s

00:00:55.739 --> 00:01:01.510
broad range of abilities actually rule out
a ton of fruits. He can already fly and has

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:06.990
superhuman strength, which means he doesn’t
need any type of Zoan fruit that gives him

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:13.640
those abilities, like Kaido’s Dragon fruit.
He also has fire powers, in my opinion ruling

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:20.960
out something like the magma or fire logia
fruits, that would be redundant. And his genetically

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:26.250
modified body gives him iron hard skin and
high defense values. So sanji doesn’t need

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:30.640
anything like the barrier or diamond fruit
either. I think that one fruit that would

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:36.180
perfectly enhance Sanji’s powers is actually
Aokiji’s ice fruit. A logia type devil fruit

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:42.409
would make sanji even more unpredictable and
harder to damage than before. Ice powers would

00:01:42.409 --> 00:01:48.630
be the perfect balance to his fire powers,
making him the Todoroki of One Piece. And

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:53.649
he can use the cold to keep food on the thousand
sunny fresh as well. More balanced than the

00:01:53.649 --> 00:02:00.079
earthquake fruit i thought, that has pretty
high collateral damage. But then it hit me.

00:02:00.079 --> 00:02:05.340
There is one fruit that’s even better for
Sanji. And that’s Robin’s hana hana no

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:10.840
mi, which would allow Sanji to kick from wherever
with countless legs, make clones of himself

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:16.921
that double all his abilities and just imagine
Sanji making a giant leg, like Robin, but

00:02:16.921 --> 00:02:23.390
using his fire abilities with it. And it would
of course also be extremely useful for cooking

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:24.390
abilities.

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:30.090
Next up we have Jinbei. Zack gave him the
mythical buddah fruit, wielded by Fleet admiral

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:35.510
Sengoku. A strong pick, let’s see if we
can improve on that. To pick the right fruit

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:39.409
for him, t’s important to remember that
Jinbei eating a devil fruit would mean that

00:02:39.409 --> 00:02:46.220
he is a fishman that can’t swim anymore.
So his fruit would have to be strong enough

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:53.050
to make up for that. And coincidentally, Oda
just gave the perfect answer to this dilemma

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:59.989
in the Manga, where he introduced Jinbei’s
cyborg clone that was created by the Government.

00:02:59.989 --> 00:03:08.440
This clone has eaten the Swim Swim fruit that
Oda suggested for Sanji. But in Jinbei’s

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:15.080
case it makes perfect sense. This fruit allows
Jinbei to use his fishman abilities on land.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:20.709
He can swim and dive on land at incredible
speeds and even use his fishman karate, which

00:03:20.709 --> 00:03:26.440
is able to manipulate liquids. I would go
so far as to say that this is the only fruit

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:31.569
that actualy makes sense for Jinbei, if we
want to respect his actual powers in the story.

00:03:31.569 --> 00:03:36.209
But let’s move on to Franky. Oda gave Franky
the Arms Arms fruit, that would enable him

00:03:36.209 --> 00:03:41.980
to turn any part of his body into a weapon,
fitting for a cyborg who can already turn

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:50.470
parts of his body into weapons. Now that would
be convenient for Franky, but i honestly don’t

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:56.750
think that a lack of weapons is a problem
for him. If anything Franky is such a great

00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:02.150
engineer that he can add those himself. After
all he already has integrated parts of Kizaru’s

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:08.390
lazer powers into his body, on top of tons
of other weapons. Zack gave him the Gasha

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:14.590
Gasha fruit, which is a non canon fruit, wielded
by Douglas Bullet, that allows the user to

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:22.190
dismantle anything and erasable it into whatever
they want. Which I can’t lie, is perfect

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:26.850
for Franky and his engineering powers. Since
he knows the plans of the pluton, he could

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:33.030
even use this fruit to reassemble the ancient
weapon. But let’s try to stay within the

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:37.639
canon. One interesting power for Franky could
be Bartolomeos barrier fruit, that would give

00:04:37.639 --> 00:04:45.660
him incredible defensive powers and make him
even more tanky than he already is. But i

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:50.259
want to go more into the offensive route.
Something like Buggy’s Bara Bara no mi would

00:04:50.259 --> 00:04:59.600
allow him to manipulate his cybord body freely.
And this could be improved by giving him Kid’s

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:04.490
Magnet fruit, that would give Franky similar
powers to Bullet’s non canon fruit. Where

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:10.030
he could use the metal in his surroundings
to upgrade and repair his body or freely assemble

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:16.691
any machine he wishes. But I think I found
one fruit that I think is the absoute perfect

00:05:16.691 --> 00:05:23.539
match for franky. Given that Franky’s bottleneck
is his Cola power, that can run out fairly

00:05:23.539 --> 00:05:29.840
quickly, Franky would be truly unstoppable
with Enel’s Goro Goro no mi. This would

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:36.380
give him infinite energy to power truly gigantic
machines and also give him incredible offensive

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:41.841
powers. He could turn the Thousand Sunny into
an indestructible force of nature. And, since

00:05:41.841 --> 00:05:46.569
we just learned in the Manga, that Vegapunk’s
technology is reverse engineered from the

00:05:46.569 --> 00:05:52.740
ancient kingdom’s, that also had unlimited
energy, in my opinion it would make Franky

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:57.530
the most powerful person in the world. So
make sure that you’re subscribed or I will

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:59.480
send Thunder God Franky to get you.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:04.500
now that of course means that it can’t be
the fruit that we give Nami. By the way that

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:11.099
is exactly the fruit that both Zack and also
Oda would give her. And yes, it seems like

00:06:11.099 --> 00:06:16.570
the perfect fit for Nami’s current powers.
But not only do I think that this powerful

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:22.000
fruit is a way better fit for Franky, as I
just explained, but I similar to Sanji and

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:29.500
his fire powers, I do think that it would
be very redundant for Nami. having the Goro

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:35.330
Goro no mi would mean that Nami would need
neither her climat tact nor Zeus anymore,

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:41.039
which both have given her immense offensive
powers. So instead of upgrading something

00:06:41.039 --> 00:06:47.660
she already has, I would rather find a devil
fruit that actually enhances her current abilities.

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:53.599
Thinking a bit out of the box, one overpowered
fruit, that I think would make Nami incredibly

00:06:53.599 --> 00:07:03.220
powerful and work well with her fighting style
could be Doflamingo’s Ito Ito no mi. Using

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:08.849
her mirages to confuse her opponent, and then
trapping them with her strings would be super

00:07:08.849 --> 00:07:15.830
cool to see. She could make clones of herself,
which would give her even more defensive powers

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:21.470
and she could fix things on board of the ship
and give first aid. But I do agree that Nami

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:26.740
could use something that goes with her weather
theme. If Luffy’s father Dragon actually

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:32.440
has something like the storm storm fruit,
that would of course be the ultimate fit for

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:39.380
nami, but it’s not confirmed, so we can’t
use it. A much better fit, instead could be

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:44.419
Big Mom’s soul soul fruit. Nami already
is using a homie to fight, and if she was

00:07:44.419 --> 00:07:49.449
able to turn anything from lightning to fire
to water into a living thing that she can

00:07:49.449 --> 00:08:00.350
control, she could manipulate the weather
and much much more. And other than Big Mom,

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:05.430
Nami would probably only use her own soul
and maybe that of her crew mates to create

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:13.720
homies. But my personal favorite and in my
opinion the perfect fruit for Nami, would

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:20.000
be Kaido’s Dragon fruit. It can naturally
create clouds in just moments, which would

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:27.260
turn the entire battle field into her terrain
where she could rain down lightning with zeus.

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:32.060
She could create wind for the sunny. Of course
she could fly and on top of everything have

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:35.450
the most ridiculous offensive power imaginable.

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:40.970
Zack gave this fruit to Usopp instead. Or
to be more precise, to Usopp’s sling shot.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:45.880
Which I find incredibly creative and would
look pretty epic, but again, we want to try

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:51.000
and work with the Straw hat’s natural abilities.
Oda’s pick for Usopp is the Pocket Pocket

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:56.760
Fruit which would endow his body with infinite
pockets, perfect for a sniper like him who

00:08:56.760 --> 00:09:01.291
needs places to store his ammo, which…i
gotta be honest is pretty lame i feel. In

00:09:01.291 --> 00:09:07.750
my opinion the only devil fruit that I want
for Usopp is a mythical human fruit, model

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:13.620
Giant. Usopp throughout the story has become
friends with the Giants of Elbaf. Dorry and

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:19.920
Broggy, Oimo and Kashi, Hairujin on Dressrosa.
The giants represent Usopp’s image of a

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:25.230
brave warrior of the sea. Usopp’s dream.
So really, what better way to make his dream

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:32.880
come true, than turning him into an actual
giant. This devil fruit clearly must exist

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:38.100
in One Piece. And it would be so perfect for
Usopp. But since it’s not official yet,

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:44.640
let’s think of a suitable alternative. Viola’s
giro grio fruit would allow him to target

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:50.839
enemies far far away, but having awakened
his observation haki on Dressrosa, i don’t

00:09:50.839 --> 00:09:56.870
think he needs that anymore honestly. Instead,
I would give Usopp a devil fruit, that was

00:09:56.870 --> 00:10:03.480
just recently revealed in the Manga. That
of marine admiral greenbull: The forest Zoan

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:08.649
devil fruit. We already know that during the
time skip Usopp has been getting really familiar

00:10:08.649 --> 00:10:16.120
with different types of plants and uses them
elusively as his ammo. Much better than the

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:21.160
pocket fruit, this would give him infinite
ammunition, he could create a forest and switch

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:28.510
position freely within it to target his enemies
and as a logia user would be way less susceptible

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:33.540
to damage. And, as we know, he could actually
use his powers to drain the energy from his

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:38.990
enemies and heal himself, something that would
be especially important for Usopp, who always

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:41.150
takes a ton of damage.

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:46.990
Which now brings me to the man we’ve all
been waiting for. How broken can we make Zoro?

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:53.070
Oda gave Zoro Kaido’s fruit, which again
makes no sense at all. Yes this fruit is incredibly

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:57.829
overpowered and you can basically give it
to anyone and it makes them strong. Just look

00:10:57.829 --> 00:11:02.880
at momonosuke. But how does turning into a
dragon complement Zoro’s incredible sword

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:07.020
skills, which is what makes him one of the
most powerful characters in the story in the

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:13.820
first place. Zack decided to give Zoro Kizaru’s
light logia fruit. A pick that i totally respect,

00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:18.670
because that would have been my first idea
for Zoro as well. This fruit let’s Zoro

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:24.079
still use his sword skills and even create
light swords as we see with Kizaru himself.

00:11:24.079 --> 00:11:30.589
Plus it gives him an incredible speed boost.
But i think we can make this even better.

00:11:30.589 --> 00:11:35.410
One great pick for Zoro, just like for Sanji
would have been Robbin’s hana hana no mi,

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:40.760
giving Zoro more Sword arms to use. But it
does work way better for Sanji. He can sprout

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:46.510
legs and kick whereever he wants. Zoro can’t
duplicate his swords, so just having arms

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:52.329
in random spaces would be a waste. Alternatively
Zoro could eat the Spider devil fruit and

00:11:52.329 --> 00:11:58.220
use that for more arms like this marine guy
does and use poison attacks. But that’s

00:11:58.220 --> 00:12:03.370
also not really like Zoro’s fighting philosophy.
Though then again you could argue that the

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:10.139
use of any devil fruit would go against zoro’s
bushido. So let’s say we hold a knife to

00:12:10.139 --> 00:12:16.880
Luffy’s throat and tell Zoro to eat a devil
fruit or else. Which one is the best? I would

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:24.330
give Zoro none other than Blackbeard’s Yami
Yami no mi. It’s ability to nullify devil

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:29.420
fruit powers depends on direct contact with
the opponent, something that very much works

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:34.149
in Zoro’s favor as a swordsman. He is able
to drain opponents of their fruit ability,

00:12:34.149 --> 00:12:40.020
so they have to face him straight on with
their own sword skills. This would make even

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:46.120
the most powerful devil fruit users powerless
against him. Just imagine Blackbeard with

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:53.740
Zoro’s sword fighting skills. Plus Zoro
could store things in his inside dimension,

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:59.200
working as infinite storage for the crew.
So let me know which one you would chose,

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:03.380
but in the meantime, make sure to check out
Zack’s original video right here and get

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.769
him over 100K.

